    "body": "## Release Notes\r\n\r\n- Allow `_e` as suffix for types in cmp. @iphydf (#116)\r\n- Add release-drafter github action. @iphydf (#115)\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Add support for `non_null`/`nullable` specs on params. @iphydf (#122)\r\n- Add support for C++ style forward declares. @iphydf (#120)\r\n- Allow `tox_` prefixes for custom attributes. @iphydf (#117)\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Correct order of `#ifdef`'d member decls. @iphydf (#118)\r\n\r\n## Maintenance (Grunt tasks)\r\n\r\n- Add reviewable config; rename release workflow to draft. @iphydf (#121)\r\n- Add more descriptive/precise tags to bazel build rules. @iphydf (#119)\r\n",
